        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 802AN, Arlington Dummy Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nVery sleek in design, this Arlington handleset features beveled edges at the top and the bottom. Dummy handlesets are for looks only. They do not lock and do not latch. They are used as a pull or to match trim on the inactive side of double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors and does not function. Does not latch or lock.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/arlington-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-800an\"><b>Arlington Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Arlington Dummy Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 802AN Arlington Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 19-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Deadbolt to Center of Top Plate: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
